### Feature Members — UPDATE (PUT) / UPDATE (PATCH)
### Leyenda: SIN AUTH (sin middleware JWT / sin autenticación)

@baseUrl = http://localhost:4000
@id = 1

# @name updateMemberPut
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/members/{{id}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Ana Pérez Actualizada",
  "description": "Miembro actualizado completamente",
  "isActive": true
}

###

# @name updateMemberPatch
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/members/{{id}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "description": "Descripción actualizada parcialmente"
}
